Before modifying legacy code, record production payloads and write high-coverage snapshot integration tests against legacy `OrderProcessor`.

#### Phase 2: Strangler Seam Injection
Introduce a feature flag seam inside the existing `OrderProcessor` to delegate sub-operations to new port-based adapters while falling back to legacy code on failure.

